{"878210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MATCHO", "steam_appid": 878210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something in Max matches what’s invading Earth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triagon wants answers. Max wants a cure. Neither has much time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND A CURE. STOP THE INVASION.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/2dd0e531cd70a4238eea74e09749e3da.poster.avif?t=1787921481\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/2dd0e531cd70a4238eea74e09749e3da.webm?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/2dd0e531cd70a4238eea74e09749e3da.mp4?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Max, a</strong> 25-year-old who spent the last 8 years <strong>locked deep underground</strong> in Triagon laboratories. His “illness” is violent <strong>outbursts of anomalous energy</strong>. There’s no permanent cure, only control, so his life depends on Triagon tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then <strong>Thomas Jetsen</strong> shows up with an emergency mission: Triagon’s military general has been taken by strange, bug-like creatures from outer space. And the impossible detail: their measured <strong>energy signature is identical to Max’s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s where the story begins. Rescue the general, push back the invasion, and uncover what Max really is. What used to ruin his life may be the only thing that can save it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE. SHOOT. THINK. CONNECT EVERYTHING.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/ccd69c6f733bedf425066e642f90cbca.poster.avif?t=1787921481\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/ccd69c6f733bedf425066e642f90cbca.webm?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/ccd69c6f733bedf425066e642f90cbca.mp4?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is a fast tactical loop: 1. <strong>Tag an enemy</strong> 2. <strong>Find at least two more of the same color</strong> 3. <strong>Execute your combo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the battlefield, strike fast, and trigger chains you created. Easy to learn yet challenging to master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it’s not just aim and cover. MATCHO gives you <strong>freeform parkour</strong> for speed and style: reposition, dash, wallrun, and strike from angles enemies won’t expect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THINK OUTSIDE THE BOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights, you’ll explore sci-fi locations, solve clever puzzles, and take on platforming challenges. The Match-3 idea shows up outside combat too, in unexpected ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven action-adventure</strong>: with dialogue, cutscenes, exploration, and set-piece fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Match-3 FPS combat</strong>: tag enemies, build chains, execute combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag &amp; Execute gameplay</strong> that rewards planning under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeform parkour movement</strong>: wall-run, double jump, dash, grapple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero-to-hero arc</strong> shaped by your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles + platforming</strong> with modern pacing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear narrative</strong> with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice acting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility options: </strong>including colorblind modes</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something in Max matches what’s invading Earth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triagon wants answers. Max wants a cure. Neither has much time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND A CURE. STOP THE INVASION.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/2dd0e531cd70a4238eea74e09749e3da.poster.avif?t=1787921481\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/2dd0e531cd70a4238eea74e09749e3da.webm?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/2dd0e531cd70a4238eea74e09749e3da.mp4?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Max, a</strong> 25-year-old who spent the last 8 years <strong>locked deep underground</strong> in Triagon laboratories. His “illness” is violent <strong>outbursts of anomalous energy</strong>. There’s no permanent cure, only control, so his life depends on Triagon tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then <strong>Thomas Jetsen</strong> shows up with an emergency mission: Triagon’s military general has been taken by strange, bug-like creatures from outer space. And the impossible detail: their measured <strong>energy signature is identical to Max’s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s where the story begins. Rescue the general, push back the invasion, and uncover what Max really is. What used to ruin his life may be the only thing that can save it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE. SHOOT. THINK. CONNECT EVERYTHING.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/ccd69c6f733bedf425066e642f90cbca.poster.avif?t=1787921481\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/ccd69c6f733bedf425066e642f90cbca.webm?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/extras/ccd69c6f733bedf425066e642f90cbca.mp4?t=1787921481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is a fast tactical loop: 1. <strong>Tag an enemy</strong> 2. <strong>Find at least two more of the same color</strong> 3. <strong>Execute your combo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the battlefield, strike fast, and trigger chains you created. Easy to learn yet challenging to master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it’s not just aim and cover. MATCHO gives you <strong>freeform parkour</strong> for speed and style: reposition, dash, wallrun, and strike from angles enemies won’t expect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THINK OUTSIDE THE BOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights, you’ll explore sci-fi locations, solve clever puzzles, and take on platforming challenges. The Match-3 idea shows up outside combat too, in unexpected ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven action-adventure</strong>: with dialogue, cutscenes, exploration, and set-piece fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Match-3 FPS combat</strong>: tag enemies, build chains, execute combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag &amp; Execute gameplay</strong> that rewards planning under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeform parkour movement</strong>: wall-run, double jump, dash, grapple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero-to-hero arc</strong> shaped by your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles + platforming</strong> with modern pacing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear narrative</strong> with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice acting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility options: </strong>including colorblind modes</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "MATCHO is a narrative first-person action adventure. Tag targets, build chains, and execute combos with an innovative real-time Match-3 combat. Join Max as he fights through an alien invasion, uncovers the truth behind his illness, and races to find a cure before Earth falls under alien control.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/e86bc17ab2caecdb5864f9d91d3727f2b2065db6/header.jpg?t=1787921481", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/38c9e1548634963806d11f1ba80e374b2ff3c655/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787921481", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/38c9e1548634963806d11f1ba80e374b2ff3c655/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787921481", "website": "https://playmatcho.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD @ 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060 / Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Target 1080p at 60FPS and Low settings</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8+ Core (e.g., Ryzen 7/9, Intel i7/i9)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060 / Radeon RX 6600 XT or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Target 1080p at 60FPS and High settings, performance may vary when using super-sampling (DLSS or FSR)</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If you don't meet the above requirements or running on a unique distro - it doesn't mean your configuration wont run MATCHO, but it can be little tricky. Share your experience in the community discussion.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2026 FiolaSoft Studio s.r.o. All Rights Reserved.", "developers": ["FiolaSoft Studio"], "publishers": ["FiolaSoft Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 4265610, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 65, "description": "Subtitle Options"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/cf5fa0de0022415c5f1e6d3eb29ff6646849cb93/ss_cf5fa0de0022415c5f1e6d3eb29ff6646849cb93.600x338.jpg?t=1787921481", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878210/cf5fa0de0022415c5f1e6d3eb29ff6646849cb93/ss_cf5fa0de0022415c5f1e6d3eb29ff6646849cb93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787921481"}, {"id